      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Recommended 60-minute flow",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Recommended 60-minute flow",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c45fc7a08ba2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57.9765625,
      "y": -46.34765625,
      "width": 491.9287109375,
      "height": 318.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6,
      "version": 57,
      "versionNonce": 2136895431,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784909507568,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "0–5 min  Clarify users, scale, browser/device constraints\n5–12 min  Functional + non-functional requirements\n12–22 min  High-level frontend architecture and data flow\n22–38 min  Deep dive: state, rendering, networking, \nperformance\n38–48 min  Reliability, testing, accessibility, security\n48–55 min  Trade-offs and alternatives\n55–60 min  Short TypeScript/React snippet + questions\n\nThink-aloud pattern:\n1. State assumption\n2. Name decision\n3. Explain benefit\n4. Name cost/risk\n5. Describe measurement or fallback",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "0–5 min  Clarify users, scale, browser/device constraints\n5–12 min  Functional + non-functional requirements\n12–22 min  High-level frontend architecture and data flow\n22–38 min  Deep dive: state, rendering, networking, \nperformance\n38–48 min  Reliability, testing, accessibility, security\n48–55 min  Trade-offs and alternatives\n55–60 min  Short TypeScript/React snippet + questions\n\nThink-aloud pattern:\n1. State assumption\n2. Name decision\n3. Explain benefit\n4. Name cost/risk\n5. Describe measurement or fallback",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
