    {
      "id": "26af820218a6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640.34375,
      "y": -72.71484375,
      "width": 358.9547424316406,
      "height": 382.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 9,
      "version": 108,
      "versionNonce": 727901449,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784909516545,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "React internals\n• What causes a render?\n• Reconciliation, keys, batching, memoization\n• useEffect vs useLayoutEffect\n• controlled vs uncontrolled inputs\n• concurrent rendering / transitions\n\nPerformance\n• 50K rows, virtualization, pagination\n• expensive derived state\n• bundle splitting and prefetching\n• Web Vitals and profiling\n\nState/data\n• server state vs UI state\n• normalized cache, optimistic updates\n• stale data, retries, cancellation\n• WebSocket / SSE / polling trade-offs",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "React internals\n• What causes a render?\n• Reconciliation, keys, batching, memoization\n• useEffect vs useLayoutEffect\n• controlled vs uncontrolled inputs\n• concurrent rendering / transitions\n\nPerformance\n• 50K rows, virtualization, pagination\n• expensive derived state\n• bundle splitting and prefetching\n• Web Vitals and profiling\n\nState/data\n• server state vs UI state\n• normalized cache, optimistic updates\n• stale data, retries, cancellation\n• WebSocket / SSE / polling trade-offs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
