      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "3. Design-system / quality areas",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Design-system / quality areas",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4c3517d58f58",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1208.98828125,
      "y": -89.11328125,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 403.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 1700426663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784909605391,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Component architecture\n• primitives → patterns → product components\n• API stability and migration strategy\n• theming, tokens, responsive behavior\n• composition vs configuration\n\nTesting\n• unit: pure logic / reducers\n• component: behavior + accessibility\n• integration: network and cache behavior\n• E2E: critical user journeys\n• visual regression: design-system changes\n\nAccessibility / security\n• keyboard + focus model\n• semantic HTML and ARIA\n• XSS, CSRF, token handling\n• iframe / plugin isolation\n• prompt injection and unsafe model output",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Component architecture\n• primitives → patterns → product components\n• API stability and migration strategy\n• theming, tokens, responsive behavior\n• composition vs configuration\n\nTesting\n• unit: pure logic / reducers\n• component: behavior + accessibility\n• integration: network and cache behavior\n• E2E: critical user journeys\n• visual regression: design-system changes\n\nAccessibility / security\n• keyboard + focus model\n• semantic HTML and ARIA\n• XSS, CSRF, token handling\n• iframe / plugin isolation\n• prompt injection and unsafe model output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
