      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "4. Practice system-design prompt: Enterprise AI Assistant",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Practice system-design prompt: Enterprise AI Assistant",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b76ff5ad48b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 59.4765625,
      "y": 451.76953125,
      "width": 814.4354248046875,
      "height": 616.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 15,
      "version": 80,
      "versionNonce": 741234185,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784909544676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Prompt:\nDesign a frontend for an enterprise AI assistant that streams answers, cites internal sources,\nruns tools, supports retry/cancel, and works on desktop and mobile.\n\nFunctional requirements\n• start / continue conversation\n• stream tokens and tool progress\n• show citations and source previews\n• cancel, retry, edit-and-resubmit\n• conversation history and search\n• feedback and error recovery\n\nNon-functional requirements\n• first response feedback < 300 ms\n• smooth token rendering at 60 fps\n• resilient to reconnects and duplicate events\n• accessible keyboard and screen-reader UX\n• secure rendering of model output\n• observable latency and failure rates\n\nArchitecture\nApp Shell\n  ├─ Conversation Router\n  ├─ Server-State Cache\n  ├─ Chat State Machine\n  ├─ Streaming Transport\n  ├─ Message Virtualizer\n  ├─ Tool/Citation Renderers\n  └─ Telemetry + Feature Flags",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prompt:\nDesign a frontend for an enterprise AI assistant that streams answers, cites internal sources,\nruns tools, supports retry/cancel, and works on desktop and mobile.\n\nFunctional requirements\n• start / continue conversation\n• stream tokens and tool progress\n• show citations and source previews\n• cancel, retry, edit-and-resubmit\n• conversation history and search\n• feedback and error recovery\n\nNon-functional requirements\n• first response feedback < 300 ms\n• smooth token rendering at 60 fps\n• resilient to reconnects and duplicate events\n• accessible keyboard and screen-reader UX\n• secure rendering of model output\n• observable latency and failure rates\n\nArchitecture\nApp Shell\n  ├─ Conversation Router\n  ├─ Server-State Cache\n  ├─ Chat State Machine\n  ├─ Streaming Transport\n  ├─ Message Virtualizer\n  ├─ Tool/Citation Renderers\n  └─ Telemetry + Feature Flags",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
