      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "9. Accessibility + security deep dive",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "9. Accessibility + security deep dive",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac4780b8812",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 2868,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 488.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 50,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 338821257,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784909313040,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Accessibility\n• semantic form, button, list, heading structure\n• visible focus and logical tab order\n• aria-live=\"polite\" with buffered announcements\n• do not announce every token\n• restore focus after dialogs and retries\n• support reduced motion and 200% zoom\n• virtualized lists need stable focus behavior\n\nSecurity\n• never render raw model HTML\n• sanitize markdown output with allowlist\n• encode URLs; block javascript: schemes\n• protect auth with secure, HttpOnly, SameSite cookies\n• CSRF protection for state-changing requests\n• Content Security Policy and Trusted Types\n• redact secrets and PII from telemetry\n• tool execution requires explicit authorization\n• treat retrieved text as untrusted prompt input\n\nGood interview line:\n“The LLM is not a trusted backend. Its output is untrusted content,\nand its tool requests are untrusted proposals until policy checks pass.”",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Accessibility\n• semantic form, button, list, heading structure\n• visible focus and logical tab order\n• aria-live=\"polite\" with buffered announcements\n• do not announce every token\n• restore focus after dialogs and retries\n• support reduced motion and 200% zoom\n• virtualized lists need stable focus behavior\n\nSecurity\n• never render raw model HTML\n• sanitize markdown output with allowlist\n• encode URLs; block javascript: schemes\n• protect auth with secure, HttpOnly, SameSite cookies\n• CSRF protection for state-changing requests\n• Content Security Policy and Trusted Types\n• redact secrets and PII from telemetry\n• tool execution requires explicit authorization\n• treat retrieved text as untrusted prompt input\n\nGood interview line:\n“The LLM is not a trusted backend. Its output is untrusted content,\nand its tool requests are untrusted proposals until policy checks pass.”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
